
CB(1)               UNIX Programmer's Manual                CB(1)

NAME
     cb - C program beautifier

SYNOPSIS
     cb

DESCRIPTION
     _C_b places a copy of the C program from the standard input on
     the standard output with spacing and indentation that
     displays the structure of the program.

BUGS
     Terminally ungrammatical programs cause core dumps.

